{
  "root": {
    "line": 1,
    "text": "定语从句",
    "children": [
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "基本概念",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 4,
            "text": "修饰名词或代词的从句"
          },
          {
            "line": 5,
            "text": "先行词：被修饰的词",
            "id": "antecedent"
          },
          {
            "line": 6,
            "text": "关系词：引导从句，并在从句中充当成分"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": "关系代词",
        "id": "pronoun",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 8,
            "text": "who：指人，作主语/宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 9,
                "text": "The man who lives next door is a doctor."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 10,
            "text": "whom：指人，作宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 11,
                "text": "The girl whom I met is Lucy."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 12,
            "text": "whose：表所属，人或物",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 13,
                "text": "I have a friend whose father is a pilot."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 14,
            "text": "which：指物，作主语/宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 15,
                "text": "This is the book which I bought."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 16,
            "text": "that：指人或物",
            "id": "that",
            "color": "orange",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 17,
                "text": "The car that he drives is new."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 18,
            "text": "作宾语时可省略",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 19,
                "text": "The book (that) I read was boring."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "关系副词",
        "id": "adverb",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 21,
            "text": "when：时间，= in/on which",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 22,
                "text": "I remember the day when we met."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 23,
            "text": "where：地点，= in/at which",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 24,
                "text": "This is the house where I was born."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 25,
            "text": "why：原因，= for which",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 26,
                "text": "That's the reason why he left."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "限制性与非限制性",
        "id": "restrict",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 28,
            "text": "限制性：无逗号，不可省",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 29,
                "text": "Students who work hard will pass."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 30,
            "text": "非限制性：有逗号，补充说明",
            "color": "blue",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 31,
                "text": "My father, who is 50, loves tennis."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 32,
            "text": "非限制性不能用 that",
            "id": "no-that",
            "color": "red"
          },
          {
            "line": 33,
            "text": "as / which 引导整句",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 34,
                "text": "As we know, the earth is round."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "易错点",
        "color": "red",
        "fold": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 36,
            "text": "只用 that 不用 which",
            "id": "only-that",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 37,
                "text": "先行词为 all、everything、nothing 等",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "line": 38,
                    "text": "All that he said is true."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "line": 39,
                "text": "先行词有最高级、序数词修饰",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "line": 40,
                    "text": "It's the best film that I've seen."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "line": 41,
                "text": "先行词既有人又有物"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 42,
            "text": "介词 + 关系代词：只能 which/whom",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 43,
                "text": "The pen with which I write is red."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 44,
            "text": "关系副词 vs 关系代词：看从句缺不缺成分",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 45,
                "text": "This is the place (which) I visited."
              },
              {
                "line": 46,
                "text": "This is the place where I live."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 47,
            "text": "先行词是 way：用 that / in which / 省略",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 48,
                "text": "I like the way (that) she talks."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 49,
            "text": "主谓一致：看先行词的单复数",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 50,
                "text": "He is one of the students who are good at English."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
